# Installer slow to open

Andrew reports the Windows Arrs Hub installer takes a long time before the UI/popup appears (even from Desktop).

## Known / likely causes (not all fixable in packaging)

1. **Windows SmartScreen / Defender** first scan of a newly built **unsigned** ~95MB Electron NSIS exe — often the main delay.
2. **UAC elevation** when installing to Program Files.
3. electron-builder NSIS assisted installer (`oneClick: false`) starts a bit heavier than one-click.

## On each rebuild / when investigating

- Prefer documenting: copy to Desktop, wait for first SmartScreen scan; subsequent opens are faster.
- Optional packaging experiments: `compression` (store vs normal), portable build for “just run” without NSIS UI.
- Code signing (cert) would help SmartScreen most — only if Andrew obtains a cert.
- Do not block feature ships solely for this; note in release notes when relevant.
